9. Children's Privacy
Our services are not directed to anyone under 18, and we do not knowingly collect their data. If you believe a child has given us data, contact us so we can delete it.
10. International Data Transfers
Some data may be processed by cloud providers outside the Kingdom. We apply the safeguards required by law for any transfer.
11. Third-Party Links and Services
The app may contain links to third parties whose privacy practices we do not control. We encourage you to review them.
12. Changes to This Policy
We may update this policy. The new version will be posted with its update date, and we will notify you in the app of any material change.
